{"availability":"available","full":"HUSNAIN-MUNAWAR/aeroramp-vision","name":"aeroramp-vision","description":"Airport turnaround and ramp-safety computer-vision platform with FastAPI, Next.js, tracking, evidence, and demo workflows","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-19T00:16:04Z","updated":"2026-07-19T08:47:36Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":["airport-operations","aviation","computer-vision","docker","fastapi","nextjs","opencv","safety","sqlalchemy","video-analytics"],"demo":"https://www.dvidshub.net/video/838428/aerospace-ground-equipment-ensures-aircraft-ready-flight","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T05:42:12.823Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T05:42:12.823Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T05:42:12.823Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T05:42:12.823Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Airport turnaround and ramp-safety intelligence platform that turns video into tracked objects, reviewable safety alerts, protected evidence, turnaround milestones, and operational dashboards.","Aviation disclaimer: AeroRamp Vision is an operational decision-support and analytics platform. It is not certified by ICAO, IATA, FAA, EASA, any CAA, airport, airline, or ground handler. Production deployment requires site-specific validation, camera calibration, cybersecurity review, privacy review, legal review, and approval from the relevant airport and aviation authorities.","Airport turnaround teams often need a shared view of stand activity, safety-rule candidates, evidence, and milestone timing without pretending that a generic computer-vision model is an aviation-certified safety system. AeroRamp Vision provides a credible open-source reference architecture for that workflow: honest detector boundaries, auditable review states, tenant-aware APIs, and a runnable local demo."],"features":["MP4/MOV/AVI decoding through OpenCV/FFmpeg-compatible codecs","CPU motion detector for generic moving-object analysis","Deterministic syntheticcolor detector for the generated demo fixture","Optional Ultralytics YOLO adapter for generic classes such as person, car, bus, truck, and aircraft","Class-aware centroid tracking with short-occlusion tolerance"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/HUSNAIN-MUNAWAR/aeroramp-vision/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"424c1bf34d4dd50e0310d2e4e0a623bf83035aaa703f43499b2892fd78815dc3","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T05:42:12.938Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T05:42:12.938Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Airport turnaround and ramp-safety intelligence platform that turns video into tracked objects, reviewable safety alerts, protected evidence, turnaround milestones, and operational dashboards.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/HUSNAIN-MUNAWAR/aeroramp-vision/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Open and sign in with the seeded development account:","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/HUSNAIN-MUNAWAR/aeroramp-vision/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Authenticated API calls require a bearer token from POST /api/v1/auth/login.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/HUSNAIN-MUNAWAR/aeroramp-vision/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"424c1bf34d4dd50e0310d2e4e0a623bf83035aaa703f43499b2892fd78815dc3","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/HUSNAIN-MUNAWAR/aeroramp-vision/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T05:42:12.938Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-07-19T08:47:36Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/HUSNAIN-MUNAWAR/aeroramp-vision/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T05:42:12.939Z","hash":"424c1bf34d4dd50e0310d2e4e0a623bf83035aaa703f43499b2892fd78815dc3","originalBytes":14671,"storedBytes":14671,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["api","scripts","docs","evidence","apps","demo","public","aeroramp","data","l